WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.779 --> 00:00:07.392
Organization is where the Owner and Admins manage who belongs to your organization, and what your plan allows.

2
00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:16.527
Open Organization in the sidebar. General shows the name of the organization, its Owner, and your role. Here, you are the Owner.

3
00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:27.395
Members lists everyone with their role. Admins help run the organization; Members work on the projects they are given. As the Owner, you change a role right here.

4
00:00:28.094 --> 00:00:36.243
To add someone, choose Invite member. Enter their email, pick the role and the projects they start on, then choose Send invitation.

5
00:00:36.962 --> 00:00:44.983
Invitations shows who was invited and whether they joined. Resend sends the email again. Revoke makes the link in it stop working.

6
00:00:45.694 --> 00:00:51.966
Guests belong to another organization and work on one of your projects. They do not count against your limits.

7
00:00:52.672 --> 00:01:01.739
E-mail inbox gives your organization addresses whose mail can become draft cards, once your platform administrator has connected a mail provider.

8
00:01:02.438 --> 00:01:07.857
Project links record how your projects depend on each other, or on something outside Guildwise.

9
00:01:08.570 --> 00:01:14.458
Plan and limits shows your plan, what you use, and the limits that apply. The Owner also sees Billing.

10
00:01:15.157 --> 00:01:20.170
That is Organization: who is in, what each person may do, and what your plan allows.
